{"slug":"Oceania","title":"Oceania","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Australia\" title=\"Australia\">Australia</a>.</div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Oceania_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"250\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Height_Map\" title=\"Height Map\">Height map</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Map</a> of <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Oceania</span> and part of South East Asia. This <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is mostly water. Mostly plains and hills with some mountains mainly in the northwest. \n</p><p>The east of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is mostly ocean but there are some small islands which makes it good for <a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">trade</a> via <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">ports</a>.  \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Oceania_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"385\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1664\" data-file-height=\"1000\"><figcaption>The Oceania map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/oceania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 22 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Australia, New Zealand, Timor Leste, Indonesia, Brunei and Singapore.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Oceania, Continental</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 22</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 0</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 2000 x 1000.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Australia\" title=\"Australia\">Australia</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>","section":"Maps"}
